  "details": "On mobile, the tutorial that appears (specifically the one that says “Tap someone to see more information and options. Give it a try!”) doesn’t disappear from the screen once tapping on someone as instructed. This leads to a large majority of the screen being obscured.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nBe on iOS and in an instance with more than one person, tap on them as instructed by the tutorial. It will not disappear no matter what.\n\nDetails\n\nCategory: User Interface\n\nFrequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: iOSMobile",
